## reasoning_effort 全链路（2026-07-26）

Provider 全链路新增 `reasoning_effort` 支持，五种思考强度：`minimal`/`low`/`medium`/`high`/`max`。

### 链路

```text
用户配置 reasoning_effort
  → run/config.py: provider_runtime_config() → normalize_reasoning_effort()
  → run/engine.py: ChatRequest.extra["reasoning_effort"]
  → provider/adapters/compat.py: chat_request_to_kemo()
    → KemoRequest.reasoning = ReasoningConfig(enabled=True, effort=...)
    → KemoRequest.provider_options["reasoning_effort"]
  → provider/adapters/compat.py: kemo_request_to_chat()
    → ChatRequest.extra["reasoning_effort"]
  → provider/adapters/chat_bridge.py
    → ProviderCapabilities.reasoning.supported = True
    → efforts = ["minimal", "low", "medium", "high", "max"]
```

### normalize_reasoning_effort

```python
def normalize_reasoning_effort(value) -> str
```

- 缺失、`None`、`"none"`、`""`、非法值 → 统一回退为 `"medium"`
- 合法值：`"minimal"`/`"low"`/`"medium"`/`"high"`/`"max"`
- 大小写不敏感
